      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "DC magnetic susceptibility of dinuclear 1 shows χT = 28.41 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K, close to two non-interacting Dy(III) ions (28.28 cm3 K mol−1), decreasing to 26 cm3 K mol−1 at 25 K; a subsequent rise of χT is attributed to ferromagnetic Dy···Dy interactions. Magnetization at 5 K saturates at 13.91 μB under 7 T with no hysteresis.",
